The System/370 processor was written from IBM's "IBM System/370 Principles of
Operation" (GA22-7000). Its behaviour is checked against the Hercules emulator
(https://github.com/SDL-Hercules-390/hyperion), which is run as an external
reference program only: no Hercules source code is included or translated here.
The IBM 360/370 simulator of Richard Cornwell (https://github.com/rcornwell/sims,
MIT licence) was consulted for comparison.

The test vectors in crates/s370/tests/vectors/ are results produced by running
test programs generated by this project under Hercules.
